    "detailed_description": "&quot;Farm Life&quot; is an arcade puzzle game that will transport you to the incredible world of farming! <br />\r\nImagine vibrant 3D graphics unfolding before you like a painting brought to life under the sun's rays.<br />\r\n The colorful landscapes of the farm captivate your gaze, instantly immersing you in an atmosphere of tranquility and joy!<br />\r\n But this isn't just a game about farming; it\u2019s a true gem for puzzle lovers!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe intuitive gameplay allows you to easily and enjoyably interact with the surrounding world. <br />\r\nSimply click on the objects that match the required shapes, and you\u2019ll progress through the levels! <br />\r\nEach new mission is a chance to showcase your skills and solve unique challenges, collecting various items and completing interesting tasks.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nFeatures:<br />\r\n<br />\r\n3D graphics<br />\r\nIntuitive gameplay<br />\r\nEngaging missions<br />\r\nInteresting locations<br />\r\n<br />\r\n&quot;Farm Life&quot; gives you the chance to be part of farm life, savoring every moment and experiencing true enjoyment from solving puzzles. <br />\r\nDiscover all its exciting features today!",
